msgstr "务必从 [.filename]#/etc/make.conf# 中移除任何特定于站点的设置。例如，分发在 `CPUTYPE` 被设置为特定处理器的系统上构建的二进制文件是不明智的。"

#. type: Title ===
#: documentation/content/en/articles/releng/_index.adoc:317
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Contributed Software (\"ports\")"
